 **Data Structures:**
-The rasterizer typically operates on a tiled grid (e.g., $16 \times 16$ pixels) to optimize memory access and sorting [S11, unofficial].
-*   **Gaussian Attributes:** Stored in contiguous tensors on the GPU [S11, unofficial].
