-            $$ T = T \cdot (1 - \alpha_i) $$
-        *   If $T$ drops below a threshold (e.g., 0.0001), break the loop for this pixel [S12, unofficial].
-    *   Store $C$ as the final pixel color and $1 - T$ as the opacity.
