+*   `bg`: Background color. Typically white `[1, 1, 1]` or black `[0, 0, 0]` [S11, unofficial].
+*   `scale_modifier`: A scalar multiplier applied to Gaussian scales during rasterization. Default is 1.0 [S12, unofficial].
